        "Validate file",
        "Extract text",
        "Extract sections",
        "Identify skills",
        "Identify projects",
        "Identify work/internship experience",
        "Identify education",
        "Identify certifications",
        "Identify leadership and achievements",
        "Normalize skills to a canonical skill taxonomy",
        "Generate embeddings",
        "Store raw and structured versions",
        "Show extracted profile for user confirmation"
